   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "🏆 Contributions: a tool to build your own benchmark, then pick its labeler · C1 an\ninteractive guideline, every rule yours (✨1) · C2 it transfers to a weak model · C3 a\nbenchmark that knows where it is unsure; you read only the picks (✨2), rounds pick the\nmost valuable (✨3), a sealed exam (✨4).",
   "originalText": "🏆 Contributions: a tool to build your own benchmark, then pick its labeler · C1 an\ninteractive guideline, every rule yours (✨1) · C2 it transfers to a weak model · C3 a\nbenchmark that knows where it is unsure; you read only the picks (✨2), rounds pick the\nmost valuable (✨3), a sealed exam (✨4).",
