   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A round: you approve the pick (an audit arm and\na hunt arm); the readers label the picks, sealed;\nyou rule each pick before seeing any label; you\nrule each patch; U grows and is relabeled under\nG_t+1; Stop when no rule changed and every\npool's bound < ε.",
   "originalText": "A round: you approve the pick (an audit arm and\na hunt arm); the readers label the picks, sealed;\nyou rule each pick before seeing any label; you\nrule each patch; U grows and is relabeled under\nG_t+1; Stop when no rule changed and every\npool's bound < ε.",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
