   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "🧮 Error = the readers' majority ≠ your first record. Error mass = size × rate, both from this round's U_rand audit (1/π weights), as a share of X; ε and b_audit are set together in the Contract. Stop: no rule\nchanged, every upper 95% bound < ε.",
   "originalText": "🧮 Error = the readers' majority ≠ your first record. Error mass = size × rate, both from this round's U_rand audit (1/π weights), as a share of X; ε and b_audit are set together in the Contract. Stop: no rule\nchanged, every upper 95% bound < ε.",
   "fontSize": 26,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "s-3f733997ba47",
   "type": "text",
